<!--
  Shared XML entity macros expanded by xmllint before VirtualDJ sees skin.xml.

  To use macros in an included XML file, add a local DOCTYPE and adjust the
  relative path from that XML file, for example:
    <!DOCTYPE defs SYSTEM "../macros.dtd">

  Escape VDJScript command separators as &amp; inside entity values.
  Escape literal percent signs as &#37; inside entity values.
-->
<!ENTITY grvResetColorFxAndFilters "deck all effect_active colorfx off &amp; deck all filter_activate off &amp; deck all filter 50&#37; &amp; wait 250ms &amp; deck all effect_active colorfx off &amp; deck all filter_activate off &amp; deck all filter 50&#37;">
